  "details": "For the time I have played VrChat I have experienced a problem as well as many others when it comes to VrChat and Oculus were you join a world or even load into the home and you get massive frame drops. These frame drops are always at 11 fps. Usually for me at least I have to either press the steam button, oculus button, and then go back into game to see if it fixed itself. At times it does but other times it remains at 11 fps. So I restart my computer. So what im asking is better compatibility with The Oculus Rift for VrChat.",
